  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-zen\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #fcf6e6; background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, #fcf6e6 0%, #fff0d0 100%); border: 4px double #e4cbaf; box-sizing: border-box; color: #7a481f; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 18px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-top: 0; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"color: #7a481f; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p><p style=\"background-color: #fff0d0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #7a481f; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 12px 20px; padding: 6px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px auto 28px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 8px 0 4px; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"border: 2px solid #a65d23; color: #7a481f; display: inline-block; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 0 0; padding: 8px 12px 8px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; vertical-align: top\" data-no-dark=\"\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><section style=\"margin: 20px auto 20px; padding: 8px 0 8px; width: 74%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><blockquote style=\"background-color: #fff0d0; background-image: linear-gradient(130deg, #fff0d0, #fcf6e6); color: #7a481f; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 12px 0; padding: 12px 18px 12px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\" data-no-dark=\"\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 20px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px auto 28px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 8px 0 4px; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><section style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><h2 style=\"border: 2px solid #a65d23; color: #7a481f; display: inline-block; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 0 0; padding: 8px 12px 8px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; vertical-align: top\" data-no-dark=\"\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2></section><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; padding-left: 22px\" data-no-dark=\"\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><p style=\"background-color: #fff0d0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #7a481f; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 12px 20px; padding: 6px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p><p style=\"background-color: #fff0d0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #7a481f; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 12px 20px; padding: 6px; text-align: left\" data-no-dark=\"\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&amp;v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"><thead data-no-dark=\"\"><tr data-no-dark=\"\"><th style=\"background-color: #a65d23; border: 1px solid #e4cbaf; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">检查项</th><th style=\"background-color: #a65d23; border: 1px solid #e4cbaf; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody data-no-dark=\"\"><tr data-no-dark=\"\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #e4cbaf; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #e4cbaf; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr data-no-dark=\"\"><td style=\"border: 1px solid #e4cbaf; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #e4cbaf; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\" data-no-dark=\"\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr data-no-dark=\"